  year={2026}, note={arXiv:2607.20967 (23 Jul 2026), CityU / HKU. BS downlink broadcast of K of B areas per slot; per-user per-area AoI resets to 0 when the user senses the area locally or loses interest; INAR(1) model of the interested-but-unobserving population with persistence rho_b; PO-RMAB; mean-field lower bound; LocMW index W_b = beta rho A / (1 - rho + rho eta); sublinear excess AoI O(K L sqrt(T log BT)); pNEUMA and FLUID trajectories, V2X-Sim with PointPillars, 400 grids x 1 KB; up to 31.6% lower AoI, +16.3% mAP@70 vs traditional max-demand}}
